{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53420","headline":"赞马氏子 · 粲和尚","name":"赞马氏子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丰姿窈窕鬓欲斜，赚煞郎君念法华。\n一把骨头挑去後，不知明月落谁家。\n（见《全闽诗话》卷十二引《感应传》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"粲和尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}